Package: DynMSR
Title: Run Heta, SBML and DynMS Models in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Evgeny", family = "Metelkin", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "evgeny.metelkin@gmail.com")
  )
Author: Evgeny Metelkin [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Evgeny Metelkin <evgeny.metelkin@gmail.com>
Description: Provides a convenient R interface for systems-biology and
    systems-pharmacology models in Heta, SBML, and DynMS formats. DynMS JSON
    files are loaded directly; Heta projects and SBML files are converted to
    DynMS by an optional compatible installation of 'heta-compiler'. Models
    can be validated, selected from a platform, and generated or built for
    simulation with 'mrgsolve' as a backend.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    jsonvalidate,
    whisker
Suggests:
    mrgsolve,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/hetalang/DynMSR
